      ","value":{"$content":["Hello there! Just coming in for a quick bite.","Welcome
      to our caf\u00e9. What can I get for you today?","One burger and a cola, please.
      Quick snack before reviewing quarterly reports.","A burger and cola sounds
      perfect after a long day. ","These late meetings are killing me. Thanks for
      staying open."," I understand completely. I''ll put that order in right away
      for you.","Appreciate it. "],"$type":"System.Collections.Generic.List`1[[System.String,
      mscorlib, Version=4.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=b77a5c561934e089]]"},"typeHandle":{"Identification":"System.Collections.Generic.List`1[[System.String,
